{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24346","headline":"偶於维扬牛相公处觅得筝筝未到先寄诗来走笔戏荅 · 白居易","name":"偶於维扬牛相公处觅得筝筝未到先寄诗来走笔戏荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚匠饶巧思，秦筝多好音。\n如能惠一面，何啻直双金。\n玉柱调须品，朱弦染要深。\n会教魔女弄，不动是禅心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}